  "sourceTitle": "Don't trust me bro: 3.49B tokens, 320,192 evals, 8 seeds, at batch size 1 over 1,062 GPU hours on a single RTX 3090. And an inference harness that fixes gpt-oss.",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2d91d6ac56b777847692a9b4cb56ff2246a183cce601eb25ffcf4158f69e5950",
